1
00:00:00,882 --> 00:00:03,972
(Penny:)You might slip on a banana peel
and get me pregnant.

2
00:00:05,011 --> 00:00:07,971
(Sheldon:)I must say,
I'm shocked by this betrayal.

3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,600
(Leonard:)I didn't betray Penny.

4
00:00:09,807 --> 00:00:11,977
(Sheldon:)Not Penny, me.

5
00:00:12,184 --> 00:00:13,644
(Leonard:)How am I betraying you?

6
00:00:13,853 --> 00:00:17,523
(Sheldon:)Elizabeth's my friend,
and you're playing with her.

7
00:00:21,235 --> 00:00:23,445
(Leonard:)Yeah, I guess I did.

8
00:00:30,244 --> 00:00:32,074
(Howard:)What the hell are you doing?

9
00:00:32,246 --> 00:00:33,996
(Raj:)Relax, it's Nyquil.

10
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:37,540
(Leonard:)-You still have a cold?
-Maybe, but I don't care.

11
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:41,760
(Raj:)That's the great thing about Nyquil,
it's like 10 percent booze.

12
00:00:41,923 --> 00:00:44,593
(Raj:)I call it the nighttime
sniffling, sneezing, coughing...

13
00:00:44,759 --> 00:00:47,049
...so-you-can-talk-to-girls medicine.

14
00:00:47,678 --> 00:00:49,218
(Leonard:)Are you having trouble sleeping?

15
00:00:49,388 --> 00:00:51,848
Because, boy, I was up all night.

16
00:00:52,058 --> 00:00:53,478
(Raj:)Did you get a cold too?

17
00:00:53,684 --> 00:00:57,024
No, I was awake all night.

18
00:00:59,523 --> 00:01:04,023
(Howard:)If you want, I can give you
some of my mom's sleeping pills.

